WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:06.337
Video 18. GSTR-1 ane GSTR-3B.

00:00:06.537 --> 00:00:10.002
Tame sales invoices ane purchase bills nondho
chho.

00:00:09.932 --> 00:00:15.710
GSTR-1 outward supplies bhega kare chhe, table
pramaane.

00:00:15.639 --> 00:00:22.522
GSTR-3B purchases no input tax umere chhe, ane
bharvaano tax bataave chhe.

00:00:22.452 --> 00:00:26.333
Darek return portal par JSON file tarike jaay
chhe.

00:00:26.633 --> 00:00:34.930
Alt+G dabaavo, ane GSTR-1 type karo. Report
chaalu mahina par khule chhe.

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:45.547
Alt+F2 thi period badlo: April thi October. 17
vouchers: 5 return ma chhe, 1 uncertain chhe.

00:00:45.577 --> 00:00:57.193
Return View ma darek table dekhaay chhe. B2B par Enter thi tran
invoices dekhaay chhe, darek kharidnaar na GSTIN saathe.

00:00:57.673 --> 00:01:05.899
Period ma 17 vouchers. 5 return ma jaay chhe.
Baakina GST maate laagu nathi.

00:01:05.829 --> 00:01:11.424
1 voucher uncertain chhe. File karta pehla
tene sudhaaro.

00:01:11.724 --> 00:01:18.451
Uncertain Transactions ma darek voucher tena
kaaran saathe dekhaay chhe.

00:01:18.101 --> 00:01:23.999
Joshi Stores registered dealer chhe, pan
ledger ma GSTIN nathi.

00:01:24.029 --> 00:01:35.144
Alt+E thi return export thaay chhe. Hisaab puchhe chhe: 1
uncertain voucher return ma nathi. Export karvu?

00:01:35.174 --> 00:01:42.709
Y thi JSON file bane chhe. Tene GST portal par
offline tool thi upload karo.

00:01:43.789 --> 00:01:53.028
GSTR-3B e j vouchers vaapre chhe. Table 3.1
outward supplies ane teno tax bataave chhe.

00:01:53.730 --> 00:02:01.331
Table 4 purchases ni input tax credit bataave
chhe: IGST ₹13,875.

00:02:01.811 --> 00:02:05.672
Aagalno video: e-Invoice ane e-Way Bill.

